" id=\"searchInput\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search pages, products, solutions\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n<div class=\"search-results\" id=\"searchResults\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"sp-main ci-main\" data-home-detail=\"\" data-preserve-case=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"--detail-header-space: 112px;\">\n<section class=\"ci-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"ci-title\">\n <img class=\"ci-hero-background\" src=\"../assets/images/contact/background-scent-20260919.webp\" width=\"1045\" height=\"484\" alt=\"Background Scent glass entrance, illuminated in blue and amber.\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"eager\">\n <div class=\"ci-container ci-hero-grid\">\n <div class=\"ci-hero-copy\"><h1 id=\"ci-title\" data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_3a59af04274c6a84df760b47\">Get In Touch</h1><h2 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_b540ff3bf8ab2da14e061601\">Let’s create what’s next.</h2>\n <p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_670540897efcb6749d5ae66a\">Whether you are developing a new product, exploring a new market, improving sensory performance, or looking for a strategic innovation partner, our multidisciplinary teams are ready to work with you.</p>\n <p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_92a23a82f48a6f7f8d0be17c\">From insight and concept development to formulation, sensory strategy and implementation, we help turn ideas into meaningful solutions.</p>\n <ul class=\"ci-cities\" aria-label=\"Our global locations\"><li data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_a71021729c8ed76af030b0b1\">Taipei</li><li data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_4fa67d8c961eb1c3f15de17d\">Bangkok</li><li data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_b0ae1c47787ac4b7ea93e435\">Tokyo</li><li data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_05015a292f7c656556644a34\">Los Angeles</li></ul></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"ci-contact-section\"><div class=\"ci-container ci-contact-grid\">\n <aside aria-labelledby=\"ci-help-title\"><h2 id=\"ci-help-title\" data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_cd5d6c7586eb7650067be1ff\">How can we help?</h2><div class=\"ci-services\">\n <article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-lightbulb\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_87287fbacdcad2edc5d6c29c\">Start a new project</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_2f6d074f2046fdc949af4327\">Bring us your idea, challenge or opportunity. We can help shape it into a clear concept and actionable development direction.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-chart-line-up\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_615cbb4bf35117eeea6b5f8f\">Develop or improve a product</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_9009774a02a0766ed2069769\">Work with our specialists across flavor, fragrance, food ingredients, functional solutions, skincare and sensory science.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-head-circuit\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_5c0d732858cd702440d0c7ce\">Sensory strategy &amp; consulting</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_f1ac2e7de9cbd4c3a9dffe6e\">Create stronger product, brand and human experiences through evidence-based sensory strategy.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-magnifying-glass\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_9279d74b20d104d8b7b0a60a\">Find a solution</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_6ce5ffb4a5978fc5df8de394\">Looking for a specific ingredient, technology, flavor, fragrance or functional solution? Our team can help identify the right approach.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-users-three\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_489c898df723784cc851ca16\">Co-creation &amp; innovation</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_c08598d302df44b871b00ec0\">Collaborate with our multidisciplinary teams from early-stage ideation through development and implementation.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-handshake\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_d74a339671079044575770e3\">Business &amp; strategic partnership</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_4caab4cdcec8941fb2e0fcbe\">Connect with us for technology collaboration, market development, distribution and long-term strategic partnerships.</p></div></article>\n </div></aside>\n <div class=\"ci-form-panel\"><h2 id=\"ci-form-title\" data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_83487a10a309ccc0386d92af\">Tell us what you’re working on.</h2><p class=\"ci-form-intro\" data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_161b95f5f590623a80c5b30b\">Fill out the form and our team will get back to you.</p>\n <form id=\"ci-form\" aria-labelledby=\"ci-form-title\" method=\"post\" action=\"../api/contact/inquiries\">\n <p class=\"ci-sr-only\" data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_8f697fa2c967ad9f207ff527\">Fields marked <span class=\"ci-required\" data-arotec-i18n-slot=\"u_8f697fa2c967ad9f207ff527:0\">*</span> are required.</p>\n <div class=\"ci-fields\">\n  <label data-preserve-case=\"true\">First name <span class=\"ci-required\">*</span><input name=\"first_name\" autocomplete=\"given-name\" placeholder=\"First name\" maxlength=\"100\" required=\"\"></label>\n  <label data-preserve-case=\"true\">Last name <span class=\"ci-required\">*</span><input name=\"last_name\" autocomplete=\"family-name\" placeholder=\"Last name\" maxlength=\"100\" required=\"\"></label>\n  <label cl